{"3781610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TimeSplit", "steam_appid": 3781610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Split is a game inspired by boomer shooters like Quake and Ultrakill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/ce184cd8ccbfc2e247b25ed3e2bd9805.poster.avif?t=1784039358\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/ce184cd8ccbfc2e247b25ed3e2bd9805.webm?t=1784039358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/ce184cd8ccbfc2e247b25ed3e2bd9805.mp4?t=1784039358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the age of a bright future and technological progress, people live happy lives full of creativity and art because machines have replaced hard work, but no one knows what was brought in the name of progress or who...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the abilities of your steel body and watch, fly on steam energy, distort time and reverse it to destroy maddened machines that have stopped obeying their master, collect gears to repair your body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/5e2691b41296de695bd6259dab138edf.avif?t=1784039358\" width=426 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unusual devices will help you on your way, but the most important of them is the clock, the better you fight, the more time scale you accumulate, it will allow you to perform crazy manipulations with time, grab enemy bullets on the fly, slow them down and speed up yourself, and if your body breaks, you can always come back and try again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/ca47d5dd43263226feaba4508e4832be.avif?t=1784039358\" width=426 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Split is a game inspired by boomer shooters like Quake and Ultrakill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/ce184cd8ccbfc2e247b25ed3e2bd9805.poster.avif?t=1784039358\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/ce184cd8ccbfc2e247b25ed3e2bd9805.webm?t=1784039358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/ce184cd8ccbfc2e247b25ed3e2bd9805.mp4?t=1784039358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the age of a bright future and technological progress, people live happy lives full of creativity and art because machines have replaced hard work, but no one knows what was brought in the name of progress or who...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the abilities of your steel body and watch, fly on steam energy, distort time and reverse it to destroy maddened machines that have stopped obeying their master, collect gears to repair your body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781610/extras/5e2691b41296de695bd6259dab138edf.avif?t=1784039358\" width=426 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unusual devices will help you on your way, but the most importa